Description: FlickOS default desktop configuration
 System-wide defaults for the FlickOS labwc session: keybindings, root menu,
 session startup programs, wallpaper, panel, notification and launcher
 styles, the Arc-Dark look (GTK theme, Numix-Circle icons, FlickOS-Arc-Dark
 labwc window theme), the FlickOS-Arc window theme for the Light style, and
 starting labwc on tty1 login.
 .
 Program configuration is installed to /etc/xdg/labwc, /etc/xdg/flickos and
 /usr/share/flickos, so it applies to every user without a personal
 ~/.config override.
